          "message": "Refactor \"disappear\" logic into its own traversal (#21901)\n\nSimilar to #21898, but for \"disappear\" logic. Previously this lived\r\ninside `hideOrUnhideAllChildren`, the function that mutates the nearest\r\nDOM nodes to override their `display` style.\r\n\r\nThis makes the feature work in persistent mode (Fabric); it didn't\r\nbefore because `hideOrUnhideAllChildren` only runs in mutation mode.",
          "tree": {
            "sha": "953eaad0c4ec7bd5f642d89d801e29b578187d68",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/react/git/trees/953eaad0c4ec7bd5f642d89d801e29b578187d68"
          },
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/react/git/commits/262ff7ad2c4a018de9992731fcf8a8f9c91083d8",
          "comment_count": 0,
          "verification": {
