            "reason": "valid",
            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJg8g8DCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAod8IAJf6CKBoGHDl1v6xj3WdiW1R\nZjwoeDFvfGEHrPbsmGNSYeRN2r91+RKbFfZTbhXe0EXPuO6egt5Btishdgz6sLxT\niMrPWLcHgcCyWtyaqlvQ3hS3VKUYPzUewZe5UcVo1jUDgPmoks//m7hDIUiOhlg2\nGdqGLqgVd5Jq50ZpWrx0Ut3GGbTpIa0X1RL2u+er73cTIy6xK7KpwlsmbDiYGo7U\nCe66+9PafkZ3aeqR09ZG1XsafOiRqN4SOi7Iz+aWWI2UYKobEc9V5vBTHYhv25F5\nzf7ZZorv85Bi7hrtJ0uP4wzCrgpejer1WPgAMmEa5CPwYJoKrNDtGBh9ElmTqNY=\n=9CHc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
            "payload": "tree 953eaad0c4ec7bd5f642d89d801e29b578187d68\nparent 34600f4fadf526028a21c94030510fbed20e4665\nauthor Andrew Clark <git@andrewclark.io> 1626476291 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1626476291 -0700\n\nRefactor \"disappear\" logic into its own traversal (#21901)\n\nSimilar to #21898, but for \"disappear\" logic. Previously this lived\r\ninside `hideOrUnhideAllChildren`, the function that mutates the nearest\r\nDOM nodes to override their `display` style.\r\n\r\nThis makes the feature work in persistent mode (Fabric); it didn't\r\nbefore because `hideOrUnhideAllChildren` only runs in mutation mode."
